      java: `class Solution {\n    public int maxVowels(String s, int k) {\n        String v = "aeiou";\n        int count = 0;\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) if (v.indexOf(s.charAt(i)) >= 0) count++;\n        int max = count;\n        for (int i = k; i < s.length(); i++) {\n            if (v.indexOf(s.charAt(i)) >= 0) count++;\n            if (v.indexOf(s.charAt(i - k)) >= 0) count--;\n            max = Math.max(max, count);\n        }\n        return max;\n    }\n}`,
